 "description": "If you enjoy the videos and want to support this project,  \nyou can do it here (no pressure, just love!) →  https://www.patreon.com/Archie_kodthai\n\nThis is not just listening.\nIt’s real practice — with subtitles, vocabulary breakdowns, and questions at the end.\n\nHere’s how it works:\n- Listen to a short Thai story or dialogue\n- Read along with subtitles\n- Learn new words (with pronunciation)\n- Listen again without help\n- Answer questions to check your understanding\nYou don’t need to understand everything, just need to listen, feel, and try.\n\nPerfect for:\n– Thai learners who want to train their ears\n– Beginners who feel lost when Thai people talk fast\n– Anyone tired of passive listening that doesn’t stick\n\nThis is the first video of my Thai Listening Practice Series, and I’ll keep making more — each one getting a little harder \n\n______________________________________________\n- Thai pronunciation guide with audio: https://kodthai.com/thai-pronunciation/\n- 500 Most Common Thai Words You MUST Know : https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLN-CdE86W-jLM1Ukn2wdQzn11r07n16bW\n- All lesson for beginner : https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLN-CdE86W-jJMaHUBXFJMRptJR2NgPVQq\n- Pronunciation : https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLN-CdE86W-jKrGYi6MI4oB1IQ0tsujPtq\n- Learn Thai While You Sleep : https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLN-CdE86W-jKtNzluLgft7usjvNorGyD9\n\nSubscribe to KOD THAI — Thai you’ll actually use 🇹🇭",
